ground's four are cut from Poly Haven (polyhaven.com) by tools/ground.sh:
gravelly_sand (Dario Barresi), grass_ground (Charlotte Baglioni),
rocky_trail (Amal Kumar) and cliff_side (photography James Ray Cock and
Dario Barresi, processing Jenelle van Heerden). Cloudbreak's two are cut
the same way: old_sandstone_02 (Dimitrios Savva, its rock) and
large_sandstone_blocks_01 (Rob Tuytel, its masonry, greyed). The arenas' are
cut the same way: brick_wall_001, marble_01, asphalt_02, brushed_concrete_2,
snow_floor and rusty_metal_02. The bases' two
are cut from ambientCG (ambientcg.com) by the same tool: MetalPlates001 (steel)
and DiamondPlate008C (tread). The boxes' other two are copied from Gates by
tools/assets.mjs: Poly Haven's concrete_wall_003 and ambientCG's
(ambientcg.com) CorrugatedSteel009; and the grass card atlas is from Poly
Haven's grass_medium_01 (baked by Gates). No attribution is required;
credited by choice.

